  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A round granny bath mat is a 50 cm disc built as a single large granny motif: concentric rounds of three-treble clusters from a central "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "magic ring",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". In chunky cotton on a 6 mm hook, each round adds roughly 4 cm to the diameter. Seven rounds gives a 50 cm bath mat. Works well in a single colour or in alternating-round stripes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
